  "body": "Executive Family Living with Sea Views & Exceptional Multi-Generational Design\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated site in the prestigious ArranHill subdivision, this exceptional residence showcases premium craftsmanship, high-end specifications, and a thoughtfully designed layout that offers both luxury and versatility.\r\n\r\nCapturing beautiful elevated views with the sea shimmering on the horizon, this impressive home has been carefully designed to accommodate modern family living while providing outstanding flexibility for extended family, guests, or independent living.\r\n\r\nThe upper level offers a spacious and elegant family home featuring 4 generous bedrooms, expansive open-plan living and dining, a beautifully appointed designer kitchen, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow onto a magnificent hardwood entertaining deck overlooking landscaped gardens and rolling lawns. The master suite provides a peaceful retreat, while the generous living spaces are ideal for entertaining or relaxing with family.\r\n\r\nDownstairs has been thoughtfully configured for independent living, offering two spacious bedrooms, an open-plan lounge and dining area, a stylish bathroom, and a convenient kitchenette designed for a microwave, fridge and small appliances. Whether accommodating extended family, teenagers, guests, or creating a work-from-home retreat, this flexible space presents endless possibilities while remaining connected to the main residence.\r\n\r\nWith multiple living areas, beautiful outdoor entertaining spaces, and quality finishes throughout, this is a home that truly caters to families seeking space, comfort and lifestyle in one of Millwater’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\nSpecial Features\r\n\r\n* Premium high-specification quality build\r\n* Prestigious ArranHill, Millwater location\r\n* Elevated position with beautiful sea views on the horizon\r\n* Six spacious bedrooms\r\n* Three beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n* Three separate living areas\r\n* Grand entrance foyer\r\n* Designer kitchen with quality appliances and premium finishes\r\n* Expansive hardwood entertainment decks on both levels\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Beautifully landscaped gardens and established planting\r\n* Large, level lawns ideal for children and pets\r\n* Flexible multi-generational living with separate lower-level accommodation\r\n* Excellent work-from-home or guest accommodation potential\r\n* Abundant natural light throughout\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* High-quality fixtures and fittings throughout\r\n* Exceptional family home with space, comfort and versatility\r\n\r\nOffering luxury, flexibility and an attractive lifestyle in one of Millwater’s most sought-after neighbourhoods, this exceptional home is perfect for growing families and those seeking quality without compromise.\r\n\r\nYour dream lifestyle begins here. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
